      <summary>FirestoreBackupService.kt — extract addArticleToBatch + withAuthenticatedUser</summary>
      <div class="pl-card">
        <p>Step 1: Extract <code>addArticleToBatch(batch, articleRef, article)</code> from the two inlined large-text-branching + <code>batch.set(articleRef, …)</code> blocks in <code>backupArticle</code> and <code>backupArticlesPaginated</code>. Step 2: Add private <code>inline suspend fun withAuthenticatedUser&lt;T&gt;</code> and replace 13 identical auth-guard patterns across all methods.</p>
