          { "kind": "add", "text": "return withAuthenticatedUser { user -> … }  // ×13" }
        ] } -->
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="pl-card-d">
      <summary>FirestoreSyncManager.kt — delete duplicate constants + delegate tag-backup + extract applyRemoteArticles</summary>
      <div class="pl-card">
        <p>Step 3: Delete <code>USERS_COLLECTION</code> and <code>ARTICLES_COLLECTION</code> from <code>companion object</code> (duplicate of <code>FirestoreBackupService.companion</code>). Step 4: Replace 28-line inline per-article tag-batch in <code>syncLocalChanges</code> with a single <code>firestoreBackupService.backupArticle(article, tags, …)</code> call. Step 5: Extract <code>applyRemoteArticles(articles)</code> from the two duplicated <code>onPage</code> lambda bodies.</p>
